bootviz (part of Tektronix_4404_Smalltalk)

This directory follows the OluxOS bootviz (github.com/merckhung/oluxos,
tools/bootviz): its Bazel layout, Vulkan renderer, compositor, application
shell and text helpers are reused, and the scene, stage script, data and
tests are new.

Parts of it are adapted from twn_election
(https://github.com/merckhung/twn_election), Copyright 2026 twn_election
authors, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (LICENSE.twn_election):
bazel/*.bzl, third_party/skia/*, tools/embed/embed_spirv.cc,
tools/gen_skia_srcs.py, src/render/vk_loader.*, src/render/vk_context.*, and
the frame plumbing in src/render/compositor.cc. Each carries a note in its
header.

Skia (fetched at build time): BSD-3-Clause, Google LLC.

data/ is recorded from this repository's VM running the Tektronix 4404
standardImage (Tektronix Smalltalk-80 T2.1.3b).
